        "action_date": "2025-10-03",
        "action_desc": "Introduced in House",
        "text": "<p><strong>Termination of Reckless Unchecked Mandates from this President Act or the TRUMP Act</strong></p><p>This bill prohibits federal funds from being obligated or expended to promulgate or issue any executive order or presidential memorandum during a lapse in discretionary appropriations (i.e., government shutdown).&nbsp;</p>",
